    "identifier": "leaf-uppercut",
    "description": "<p>You perform a single backflip kick or rising uppercut with enough force to crack the ground underneath you. Make a single melee taijutsu attack. On a hit, you knock the creature 30 feet into the air dealing 3d6 bludgeoning damage.</p>\n<p>If you cast a Taijutsu Finisher that has Leaf in its name, it increases its damage by +1 damage die.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d6.</p>",
